[00:00.9600]作词：秦天
[00:00.9600]作曲：秦天
[00:00.9600]I put it down on my life
[00:02.5800]That I love you from the bottom of my heart
[00:04.8300]Cause you the sweetest thing ever in my life
[00:07.7300]I cry so many times
[00:09.4000]So many true lies
[00:10.8400]But I'm the one that will
